 Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI官宣自研人形机器人并布局AI硬件，计划2027年启动IPO</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Nscale斩获Anthropic 450亿美元算力大单，合同总收入突破1000亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.1模型，强化Agent编码能力并最高降本45%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国司法部介入纽约时报诉OpenAI案，主张AI模型训练属于合理使用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国司法部（DOJ）于9月1日向曼哈顿联邦法院提交“利益声明”，正式介入《纽约时报》诉OpenAI版权侵权案，明确支持OpenAI立场，主张AI公司使用受版权保护材料训练大语言模型属于“合理使用”。司法部指出，若版权规则显著增加AI开发难度，将损害美国AI产业竞争力并引发国家安全风险。DOJ强调，大语言模型训练具有“转换性”目的，其创造性潜力与公共利益远超潜在的竞争损害。此举引发原告方强烈反弹，《纽约时报》批评政府牺牲创作者权益以偏袒万亿市值AI公司。该案源于2023年12月，涉及OpenAI及微软非法使用新闻文章训练AI系统的指控。目前，主审法官西德尼·斯坦已要求双方在9月4日前提交简易判决动议。作为AI版权诉讼的标志性事件，此案判决结果将为AI模型训练的合法性确立关键先例，直接影响行业后续的数据获取与合规路</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度基础模型部引入武钦与魏浩然，加速文心多模态大模型技术升级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度基础模型研发部（BMU）近日完成核心团队重组，引入北美知名Frontier Lab资深研究员武钦强化预训练底层能力，并由原DeepSeek研究员魏浩然出任文心多模态算法负责人。此次人事变动由今年7月上任的BMU负责人孙天祥主导，旨在通过组织与技术革新，对齐国际顶尖AI实验室研发节奏。百度在基础模型领域迭代迅速，2025年6月开源文心大模型4.5系列，9月推出X1.1版本提升事实准确性34.8%，并于11月发布参数规模达2.4万亿的原生全模态文心大模型5.0。此次行业核心人才的加盟，标志着文心大模型在组织效率与多模态技术攻关上进入新阶段，将进一步提升百度在AI基础模型领域的竞争壁垒。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI官宣自研人形机器人并布局AI硬件，计划2027年启动IPO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b3539be74eca7f9adcc48fb6b570bbed.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI首席执行官Sam Altman正式确认公司将自研人形机器人，并由Aditya Ramesh领导OpenAI Robotics团队，核心逻辑在于机器人硬件与机器学习的深度协同。短期内，OpenAI将研发协助基础设施建设的机器人，长期目标是普及个人机器人。在AI硬件方面，由Jony Ive操刀、代号“Gumdrop”的首款无屏便携AI终端预计2027年发布，售价超300美元，主打手写转录与实时语音交互。为推进硬件矩阵，OpenAI已从苹果、谷歌挖角数百名工程师，并与富士康合作生产。尽管面临苹果关于商业机密的法律诉讼，OpenAI仍加速布局，其2025年年化收入达200亿美元，并计划于2027年正式IPO。目前OpenAI正面临营收增速放缓及运营亏损压力，需应对Anthropic等强劲对手的竞争。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Nscale斩获Anthropic 450亿美元算力大单，合同总收入突破1000亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英国云服务商Nscale近期与Anthropic签署价值450亿美元的算力协议，推动其合同总收入从510亿美元跃升至约1030亿美元。该订单的落地标志着Nscale业务规模实现翻倍增长，目前公司持有的合同平均期限约为5.7年，折算年均合同规模约180亿美元。凭借这一显著的业务扩张，Nscale正加速资本化进程，计划最早于本月启动IPO。此次合作不仅巩固了Nscale在AI算力基础设施领域的市场地位，也反映了当前AI大模型企业对高性能计算资源的巨大需求。随着多项AI客户合同的持续注入，Nscale已成为算力基础设施赛道的重要参与者，其后续上市表现将成为行业关注焦点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.1模型，强化Agent编码能力并最高降本45%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/749dfbb4e330d82b400177a19275e366.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布新一代AI模型Claude Fable 5.1及受限变体Mythos 5.1，重点提升Agent编码与科研逻辑能力。Fable 5.1已通过API全量开放，Mythos 5.1则面向网络安全与生命科学领域提供受限访问，且两款模型均为首批内置AI文本水印的Claude产品。性能方面，Fable 5.1在Terminal-Bench 4.0编码测试中得分55.8%，科学研究测试得分52.6%，性能较前代翻倍。安全性上，新模型优化了过滤机制，网络安全误报率降低60%，生物学无害查询误报率下降85%。经济性方面，通过将缓存读取价格降至每百万Token 0.25美元，Fable 5.1在典型工作负载下可节省25%成本，复杂Agent工作流最高降本达45%，旨在解决企业级应用中的高成本痛点，推动高</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
